# ry_ak13 — Ry(arccos√(8/13)) (AKLT₄ site-2 bond-0 분기 CG 반각; V4 승인 module). 우측환경 R₁=diag(13,14)/27 유래. controlled-Ry 분해(CX 켤레)용 반각. Ry(α)=YPowGate(exponent=α/π) up-to-phase(C4). analytic golden.
```python id=bloq
import numpy as np
from qualtran.bloqs.basic_gates import YPowGate
bloq = YPowGate(exponent=float(np.arccos(np.sqrt(8.0/13.0)) / np.pi))
```
```python id=golden
import numpy as np
a = np.arccos(np.sqrt(8.0/13.0))
golden = np.array([[np.cos(a/2), -np.sin(a/2)], [np.sin(a/2), np.cos(a/2)]], dtype=complex)
```
